// Eonmark techs. Schema: crates/rules/src/techs.rs (deny_unknown_fields).
// List index is the TechId. Each line's levels are listed in order: level
// k of a line requires level k-1 of the same line (researched), and
// ages.ron unlocks level k in age k. host is the buildings.ron kind that
// researches it; cost is per resource id (zero entries omitted) and
// research_time_ds is in deciseconds, both before the Letters rows.
//
// modifiers are (target: StatPath, op: Set | Add | Mul, value: integer).
// StatPath is YieldCap, PopCap, TownLimit, TownBorderRadius, ResearchCost,
// ResearchTime, UnitHp(sel) or UnitDamage(sel), with sel Military (every
// non-Civilian class), Class(Infantry) or Kind("bowman"). Mul is permille
// (900 = x0.9) and floors after each row. Resolution: the last Set, then
// every Add, then each Mul in order; faction rows come first, then the
// researched techs in TechId order. See docs/DATA_FORMAT.md.
(
  techs: [
    (
      id: "arms_1",
      name: "Arms I",
      line: "arms",
      level: 1,
      host: "scriptorium",
      cost: {"ore": 50, "lore": 75},
      research_time_ds: 300,
      modifiers: [
        (target: PopCap, op: Add, value: 25),
        (target: UnitHp(Military), op: Mul, value: 1100),
